      "name": "integration-backlog",
      "title": "/integration-backlog — drive the backlog to zero, one PR at a time",
      "description": "Dispatcher for the `/integration-backlog <axes>` slash command. Works the backlog identified by the integration watchers (proof, canonical, compute, detangler, one-voice) by clustering the open findings into review-sized batches (≤ 49 files per PR — the Gemini review limit), proposing each batch to the author via structured AskUserQuestion calls, running `/prepare-merge` on each, resolving review comments (auto if mechanical, structured AskUserQuestion if architectural), then merging — and repeating until the axis is exhausted or the author signals stop. Sister command to `/integration-watch`: the watcher MONITORS for new events; this skill WORKS the backlog the watcher already catalogued.",
